# Deny everything, then name what the build needs.
#
# A denylist fails open: the next credential or state file dropped into
# this repo lands in the build context by default, and anything in the
# context is one `COPY . .` away from the image. This fails closed --
# forgetting an entry breaks the build instead of leaking a file.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
# Not needed to compile -- the embedded copy lives under internal/ --
# but the binary carries the font, so the image should carry its licence.
!assets/fonts/OFL.txt
